      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the devices is in S0, won\u0027t this make the AP think that there are 2 events waiting? (one from the GPIO and one from the host events sub-system) How does this interact with the AP taking a timestamp close to when an MKBP event is receive (for tight timestamp support)?",
