      "writtenOn": "2019-07-16T17:19:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The expectation here is that the host will not set MKBP mask for S0. Instead it will be set only for S0ix. Thus, when active (in S0), MKBP event will be notified only via GPIO.",
      "parentUuid": "568820f1_600e8295",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 2,
