      "message": "I thought in the near future, some x86 boards could also wake from the MKBP GPIO? If that\u0027s the case, then they would only need to define CONFIG_MKBP_USE_GPIO.\n\nIf we\u0027ll never do that for x86 boards, then maybe I can auto define it.",
